Vnum            12012
Name            裂魄微界座~
Description
微界座像整段微界深井最後一塊仍勉強聚得住形的細痕石座，腳下環界只剩一圈幾乎會被漏看的微粒薄紋，所有殘痕都在這裡被拖往更深的裂魄塵界。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        12011
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        12101
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         微界座~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深處~
End

End
